{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And YHWH said to Moses: Speak to Aaron your brother, that he come not.</b> So that he not die, in the manner that his sons died." "<b>That he die not.</b> For if he comes [improperly] he dies (Sifra)." "<b>For in a cloud I appear.</b> For I am constantly seen there with a pillar of cloud, and since the revelation of My Shekhinah is there, he must beware not to become accustomed to entering — this is its plain sense; and its midrash: he shall not come except with the cloud of the incense on Yom Kippur (Yoma 53)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:06:41.371432210Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}